   "text": "Webhook authentication\n• Twilio: HMAC-SHA1 X-Twilio-Signature over\n  public URL + sorted params\n• Brevo: shared secret (Bearer or Basic),\n  constant-time safeEqual\n• Always enforced (no bypass)",
   "originalText": "Webhook authentication\n• Twilio: HMAC-SHA1 X-Twilio-Signature over\n  public URL + sorted params\n• Brevo: shared secret (Bearer or Basic),\n  constant-time safeEqual\n• Always enforced (no bypass)",
