   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Data-layer integrity and audit\n• Tenant scoping: other providers' rows return 404, never 403 (no existence leak)\n• Calendar writes: withProviderLock(tx, userId) first, then validate + write\n  in the same transaction; half-open interval overlap check\n• Postgres backstops: EXCLUDE appointments_no_provider_overlap,\n  unique (userId, lower(btrim(email))) for active patients\n• logAudit({ tx, required: true }): an audit failure rolls back the change\n  (actor, IP, diff, source API / PUBLIC_PORTAL / JOB)\n• Outbound Twilio / Brevo / Google: recipients masked in logs",
   "originalText": "Data-layer integrity and audit\n• Tenant scoping: other providers' rows return 404, never 403 (no existence leak)\n• Calendar writes: withProviderLock(tx, userId) first, then validate + write\n  in the same transaction; half-open interval overlap check\n• Postgres backstops: EXCLUDE appointments_no_provider_overlap,\n  unique (userId, lower(btrim(email))) for active patients\n• logAudit({ tx, required: true }): an audit failure rolls back the change\n  (actor, IP, diff, source API / PUBLIC_PORTAL / JOB)\n• Outbound Twilio / Brevo / Google: recipients masked in logs",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "svc_sec",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
